                      "bullet": "-",
                      "indent": 0,
                      "text": "We discussed the two main options:",
                      "contentBegin": 831,
                      "contentEnd": 865,
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "type": "paragraph",
                          "begin": 831,
                          "end": 866,
                          "text": "We discussed the two main options:",
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "type": "plain-text",
                              "begin": 831,
                              "end": 865,
                              "value": "We discussed the two main options:"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "plain-list",
                          "begin": 866,
                          "end": 1013,
                          "listType": "unordered",
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "type": "item",
                              "begin": 866,
                              "end": 936,
                              "bullet": "*",
                              "indent": 2,
                              "text": "first a large publisher then a regional one (Nordic Nature Press)",
                              "contentBegin": 870,
                              "contentEnd": 935,
                              "children": [
                                {
                                  "type": "paragraph",
                                  "begin": 870,
                                  "end": 936,
                                  "text": "first a large publisher then a regional one (Nordic Nature Press)",
                                  "children": [
                                    {
                                      "type": "plain-text",
                                      "begin": 870,
                                      "end": 935,
                                      "value": "first a large publisher then a regional one (Nordic Nature Press)"
                                    }
                                  ]
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "item",
                              "begin": 936,
                              "end": 1013,
                              "bullet": "*",
                              "indent": 2,
                              "text": "first the regional publisher and then the large one as a pocket edition",
                              "contentBegin": 940,
                              "contentEnd": 1011,
                              "children": [
                                {
                                  "type": "paragraph",
                                  "begin": 940,
                                  "end": 1012,
                                  "text": "first the regional publisher and then the large one as a pocket edition",
                                  "children": [
                                    {
                                      "type": "plain-text",
                                      "begin": 940,
                                      "end": 1011,
                                      "value": "first the regional publisher and then the large one as a pocket edition"
                                    }
                                  ]
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "paragraph",
                          "begin": 1013,
                          "end": 1337,
                          "text": "Going first to the regional publisher seems to be the path of least resistance given we have no experience with the large ones. We submit with minimal changes (=taking into account the first readers + adding the species map into the book) and Sam will look into how to place a pocket edition (or else a magazine series).",
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "type": "plain-text",
                              "begin": 1013,
