                              "value": "  Going first to the regional publisher seems to be the path of least resistance given we have no experience with the large ones. We submit with minimal changes (=taking into account the first readers + adding the species map into the book) and Sam will look into how to place a pocket edition (or else a magazine series)."
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
